J0wytiQi39PtSV9hdZbTU6aMos7eBZLFxps4x4nik_t0D9OR4vCic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxHDGog959JFBAAwZyP0aFG71amrgYMCsRfZLHYVvILyA&oe=69B7F12E"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175727.png", "id": "1630611974467428", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411988_1630611977800761_7635821973011666471_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FK1qyOg40UAQ7kNvwHnfceR&_nc_oc=Adk2qbsi2g5gBzhmyU2oK9jX3Ll19Vu-HG2Pqj54N6Kk1aZVptdicFp27frc57ZrOYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxBKSODHwcyIfdOe4g4hxMJ_H3FAKNubnANlpjGXGfKBw&oe=69B7E2AE"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175713.png", "id": "549067324527740", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_549067327861073_2529266429934636058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DfHDJRWMPvYQ7kNvwHSTQzm&_nc_oc=Adl2F5jrIP_Ls5FrJwkur56JJSPNVc6QfMumV3zEDIP9hB8g9j3fbZvzu_4XH0tv1BM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz7GTK9zK7EeXptgLk8Q3x0lJpp9yx1OL_DwPtZRh1TAQ&oe=69B7FE7B"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175750.png", "id": "1233285141120740", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974456_1233285144454073_4577451540501517425_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6-y6-USp2HgQ7kNvwG57ShH&_nc_oc=AdkKgTBHbvVbBOs1eyQF3d9BB_6hxMtxNQi6CYbdWP_DSAIb2E6eTCnlQwfzkryDKKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfymwJtcUq1KgjLEDt5qMkWWAYcJlw5yWPIeC4C4Ekj_MQ&oe=69B8040F"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175810 (1).png", "id": "1549630812590254", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984460_1549630815923587_3757692530628789073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7AHLrCKky24Q7kNvwFya-r4&_nc_oc=Adm-DB94g3Sobx9yFTqaMYC1Za0yS_t2LVg2Xd_kJ-WZaj4ZkaGkrYsOlDiMCn-nJhI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz5cmuHOwzgFSSt5z2OCcLl_kGREUYYoQ6THNRNPd-zGg&oe=69B7FC23"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wells Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer runs out. Runners must avoid being tagged and use the environment and power-ups to outmaneuver the Taggers.\n\nGame Modes:\n\nClassic Tag: Traditional tag mode where Taggers must tag all Runners to win.\nInfected Tag: Tagged players become Taggers, spreading the infection until only one Runner remains.\nFreeze Tag: Tagged players are frozen in place until a teammate unfreezes them. Taggers win by freezing all players.\nMaps:\n\nUrban Playground: Navigate through a bustling cityscape with rooftops, alleys, and parks.\nEnchanted Forest: A magical forest filled with hiding spots and mystical creatures.\nSpace Station: A futuristic environment with zero-gravity zones and space-themed obstacles.\nPower-Ups:\n\n\n", "short_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer."}]}, "developer_name": "Wells_VR", "developer_privacy_policy_ur